{"version":1,"content":"<p>網傳內地國慶黃金周期間，一名男子在高鐵座位上大便，相關影片引發熱議。</p><p>廣鐵長沙客運段昨晚（14日）通報事件稱，該男子疑似醉酒，目前因擾亂列車秩序的違法行為被鐵路公安機關處以行政拘留處罰。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.926101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:09:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:45.039962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"ec34cb77d26179b4599704d526c26d4befa5685cac0a837eb157dec89aff11cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}